# Social Media Management - Environment Setup

Copy these variables to your `.env.local` file and configure them:

```bash
# ==========================================
# VERCEL AI CONFIGURATION
# ==========================================

# Choose your AI provider:
# Option 1: OpenAI (GPT-4 Turbo recommended)
VERCEL_AI_MODEL=gpt-4-turbo
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-your_actual_key_here_replace_with_real_key

# Option 2: Anthropic (Claude 3 recommended)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-...your_anthropic_key...

# ==========================================
# FACEBOOK/META CONFIGURATION
# ==========================================

# Facebook App credentials
# Get these from: https://developers.facebook.com/apps/
FACEBOOK_APP_ID=your_app_id
FACEBOOK_APP_SECRET=your_app_secret
FACEBOOK_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3000/api/auth/facebook/callback

# For production:
# FACEBOOK_REDIRECT_URI=https://yourdomain.com/api/auth/facebook/callback

# ==========================================
# DATABASE CONFIGURATION
# ==========================================

# Neon PostgreSQL (Serverless)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host/database?sslmode=require

# ==========================================
# REDIS CONFIGURATION (Optional but recommended)
# ==========================================

REDIS_URL=redis://default:password@host:port

# ==========================================
# AUTOMATION SCHEDULE
# ==========================================

# Enable automation worker (runs every hour)
ENABLE_AUTOMATION_WORKER=true

# Cron schedule for automation (if using external cron service)
# Examples:
# - "0 * * * *" = Every hour
# - "0 9 * * *" = Daily at 9 AM
# - "0 9 * * 1" = Every Monday at 9 AM
AUTOMATION_CRON_SCHEDULE=0 * * * *

# ==========================================
# SOCIAL MEDIA SETTINGS
# ==========================================

# Default posting time (if not scheduled by user)
DEFAULT_POST_TIME=09:00

# Maximum posts per automation run
MAX_POSTS_PER_RUN=5

# Content generation timeout (milliseconds)
AI_GENERATION_TIMEOUT=30000

# Enable paid ads feature
ENABLE_PAID_ADS=true

# Default ad budget (in your currency)
DEFAULT_AD_BUDGET=50

# ==========================================
# LOGGING & MONITORING
# ==========================================

# Log level: debug, info, warn, error
LOG_LEVEL=info

# Enable detailed logging for social content operations
DEBUG_SOCIAL_CONTENT=false

# Send alerts on posting failures
ALERT_ON_FAILURE=true
FAILURE_ALERT_EMAIL=admin@yoursite.com

# ==========================================
# RATE LIMITING
# ==========================================

# API rate limit (requests per minute)
API_RATE_LIMIT=60

# AI generation rate limit (requests per day)
AI_RATE_LIMIT_PER_DAY=1000
```

## Setup Instructions

### 1. Get OpenAI API Key
1. Go to https://platform.openai.com/
2. Create account or log in
3. Navigate to API Keys
4. Create new secret key
5. Copy and paste into `OPENAI_API_KEY`

### 2. Get Anthropic API Key (Optional)
1. Go to https://console.anthropic.com/
2. Create account or log in
3. Create API key
4. Copy and paste into `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`

### 3. Setup Facebook Developer App
1. Go to https://developers.facebook.com/
2. Create new app or use existing
3. Add "Facebook Login" product
4. Configure OAuth redirect URIs
5. Get App ID and App Secret
6. Add to environment variables

### 4. Install Dependencies
```bash
npm install ai openai @anthropic-ai/sdk
```

### 5. Database Migration
```bash
# Create tables for social content
psql $DATABASE_URL < scripts/04-create-social-content-table.sql

# Or via TypeScript migration
npm run db:init
```

### 6. Test Configuration
```bash
# Test AI generation
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/social-content \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "productId": 1,
    "platform": "instagram",
    "action": "generate",
    "contentType": "promotional"
  }'
```

## Production Deployment

### Environment Variables
Set these in your Vercel/hosting provider dashboard:
- All API keys and secrets
- Database URL
- Environment-specific settings

### Database
- Ensure neon.tech project is set up
- Run migrations on production database
- Set up automated backups

### Automation Scheduling
Option 1: Use Vercel Cron (serverless)
```typescript
// pages/api/cron/social-content.ts
export default async function handler(req, res) {
  if (req.headers.authorization !== `Bearer ${process.env.CRON_SECRET}`) {
    return res.status(401).end();
  }
  
  await runAutomationWorker();
  res.status(200).json({ success: true });
}
```

Option 2: External Cron Service (EasyCron, Cron.jobs)
- URL: `https://yourdomain.com/api/cron/social-content`
- Secret: Set `CRON_SECRET` in environment

Option 3: Scheduled Task (Node.js)
```typescript
// Use node-cron package
import cron from 'node-cron';

// Run every hour
cron.schedule('0 * * * *', async () => {
  await runAutomationWorker();
});
```

### Error Monitoring
- Set up Sentry or LogRocket
- Monitor API errors
- Alert on posting failures
- Track AI generation issues

### Performance Monitoring
- Monitor API response times
- Track automation execution time
- Monitor database query performance
- Track token usage

## Troubleshooting

### OpenAI API Errors
- Check API key is valid
- Check rate limits not exceeded
- Check account has sufficient credits
- Review error messages in logs

### Facebook Authentication
- Verify App ID and Secret
- Check OAuth redirect URI matches exactly
- Ensure Facebook Login product is enabled
- Check permissions are granted

### Database Connection
- Verify DATABASE_URL is correct
- Check network connectivity
- Ensure SSL is properly configured
- Verify credentials

### Automation Not Running
- Check ENABLE_AUTOMATION_WORKER is true
- Verify cron job is configured
- Check logs for error messages
- Ensure database is accessible

